<title>HONG KONG: HK's KEL initial public offer 173 times subscribed.</title>
<headline>HK's KEL initial public offer 173 times subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electrical and mechanical engineering services concern KEL Holdings Ltd said on Friday its offer of 100 million shares to the public at HK$1.00 per share was 173 times subscribed.</p>
<p>KEL, a spinoff of marine engineering group UDL Holdings Ltd, said in statement that trading of the shares on Hong Kong stock exchange is expected to begin on April 24.</p>
<p>Amsteel Corporate Finance (H.K.) Ltd is the sponsor and manager of the issue, and UOB Asia Ltd is the co-sponsor.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
